m1	370,1305,1560,1535		Bass clef, one flat, common time; one bar of eight notes on a level middle pitch whose last two fall a Fourth, set to "Ich bin spazieren gegangen" / "I have been walking this morning": the spoken affirmative ending.
m2	375,1582,1562,1805		Bass clef, one flat, common time; the same level pitch whose last two notes rise a Fifth, set to "Bist du spazieren gegangen?" / "Have you been walking this morning?": the spoken interrogative ending.
